### 이벤트 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-001

{
  "source": "jenkins",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "payload": "PR #42 빌드 실패"
}

### 같은 키로 중복 요청 (멱등성 테스트)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-001

{
  "source": "jenkins",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "payload": "PR #42 빌드 실패"
}

### 다른 키로 새 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-002

{
  "source": "monitoring",
  "eventType": "ALERT_TRIGGERED",
  "payload": "CPU 사용률 90% 초과"
}

### Validation 에러 테스트 (source 누락)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-003

{
  "source": "",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED"
}
